<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech CNB-120 index rises 3.0 points to 741.7 pts.</title>
<headline>Czech CNB-120 index rises 3.0 points to 741.7 pts.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CNB-120 index, a broad daily measure of Czech equities, rose three points on Wednesday to 741.7 points, the Czech National Bank (CNB) said.</p>
<p>Seven of the 10 sectoral indices gained, with the transport and telecommunication index rising the most, up 23.2 points to 1,175.9.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
